3. Inspect ownership/transfers and decide sources -> proposal "Inventory and ingredient matching", "Ordinary click placement", and "Proposed implementation boundaries" -> eligible personal storage, output exclusion, no loss, preflight and native reconciliation -> verified identifiers and concrete inventory behavior:
